1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,467
Out in the field,
sensor data goes missing.

2
00:00:03,667 --> 00:00:06,307
Distance, crops, weather.

3
00:00:06,307 --> 00:00:09,867
The signal fades,
and readings never arrive.

4
00:00:10,067 --> 00:00:13,567
AgLink is a smart field modem,
made by RUTA.

5
00:00:13,767 --> 00:00:17,600
Two antennas listen at once,
and it takes the stronger signal.

6
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:20,680
An AI model on the device
predicts packet loss

7
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:23,833
before it happens,
so it can adapt in time.

8
00:00:24,033 --> 00:00:27,467
No cloud round trip.
The data gets through.

9
00:00:27,667 --> 00:00:30,027
AgLink. By RUTA.
